    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24215" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δετός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that may be bound,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλάμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					4.289
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δετή, ἡ,</span>
			<i>faggot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιόμεναι δεταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.554
				</span></i>
			; <i>torch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1361
			</span></i>; also, <i>fetter,</i> and <i>sheaf,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
